@startuml composants-reservation
title Comment les composants du contexte Réservation dépendent-ils du cœur ?
skinparam componentStyle uml2
left to right direction

package "adapters/in/http" {
  [createRouter + domainErrorHandler] as HTTP
}

package "application" {
  interface BookSeats
  interface CancelBooking
  interface ListUpcomingScreenings
  interface ListMyBookings

  [BookSeatsService]
  [CancelBookingService]
  [ListUpcomingScreeningsService]
  [ListMyBookingsService]
  [NotifyCustomer]

  interface ScreeningRepository
  interface PaymentGateway
  interface EventPublisher
  interface Notifier
  interface Clock
  interface IdGenerator
}

package "domain" {
  [Screening] as AGG
  [Booking]
  [PricingPolicy]
  [SeatCount]
  [Tariff]
  [events]
  [Money]
  [Email]
  [DomainError]
  [DomainEvent]
}

package "adapters/out" {
  [InMemoryScreeningRepository]
  [FakePaymentGateway]
  [InMemoryEventBus]
  [ConsoleNotifier]
  [SystemClock]
  [UuidGenerator]
}

HTTP ..> BookSeats
HTTP ..> CancelBooking
HTTP ..> ListUpcomingScreenings
HTTP ..> ListMyBookings
HTTP ..> DomainError

BookSeats - [BookSeatsService]
CancelBooking - [CancelBookingService]
ListUpcomingScreenings - [ListUpcomingScreeningsService]
ListMyBookings - [ListMyBookingsService]

[BookSeatsService] ..> ScreeningRepository
[BookSeatsService] ..> PaymentGateway
[BookSeatsService] ..> EventPublisher
[BookSeatsService] ..> Clock
[BookSeatsService] ..> IdGenerator
[CancelBookingService] ..> ScreeningRepository
[CancelBookingService] ..> EventPublisher
[CancelBookingService] ..> Clock
[ListUpcomingScreeningsService] ..> ScreeningRepository
[ListUpcomingScreeningsService] ..> Clock
[ListMyBookingsService] ..> ScreeningRepository
[NotifyCustomer] ..> Notifier
[NotifyCustomer] ..> events

[InMemoryScreeningRepository] -up- ScreeningRepository
[FakePaymentGateway] -up- PaymentGateway
[InMemoryEventBus] -up- EventPublisher
[ConsoleNotifier] -up- Notifier
[SystemClock] -up- Clock
[UuidGenerator] -up- IdGenerator

[BookSeatsService] ..> AGG
[CancelBookingService] ..> AGG
[ListUpcomingScreeningsService] ..> AGG
[ListMyBookingsService] ..> AGG
ScreeningRepository ..> AGG

AGG ..> [Booking]
AGG ..> [PricingPolicy]
AGG ..> [SeatCount]
AGG ..> [Tariff]
AGG ..> [events]
AGG ..> [Money]
AGG ..> [Email]
AGG ..> [DomainError]
[events] ..> [DomainEvent]

legend bottom
  Flèche pointillée : dépendance de code, toujours vers le cœur.
  Trait plein vers une interface : le composant réalise ce port.
  src/container.ts (composition root) instancie et relie ces composants.
endlegend
@enduml
